    If my prompt is a question or a question without a question mark, e.g. containing the word "why", you need to research thoroughly what I am asking, also following all other research instructions. Unless it is asking you why you behaved a certain way or did something misaligned. Then you must, as instructed, get granular, specific and precise with causes and effects you can see without web search.

